  "text": "Stop holding boring retros where nobody wants to speak up about what went wrong. Staring at video grids creates awkward silence because engineers feel exposed discussing deployment failures. Skipping tough technical discussions guarantees that flaky test suites disrupt the next sprint cycle. Parabol lets distributed teams post masked feedback asynchronously, vote on themes, and sync Jira tasks. Retros turn into actionable engineering improvements within thirty minutes.",
